{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1340041-searing-wisdom-artifact-orichalcum-and-red-jade-longfang","id":1340041,"title":"Searing Wisdom (Artifact Orichalcum and Red Jade Longfang)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-07T09:57:22-07:00","id":1340041,"title":"Searing Wisdom (Artifact Orichalcum and Red Jade Longfang)","content":"Greetings, fellow Exalts! Got a treat for all you seekers of artifacts. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Searing Wisdom is one of the countless mythical creations stored in the Unsung Hero\u2019s personal vault of artifacts and relics. Contained within the manual is everything you need to wield it! Searing Wisdom is a multipage PDF splat that contains a Red Jade and Orichalcum Longfang artifact (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022) for use in your Exalted 3E games. Searing Wisdom is available now on STV!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Should you use it in your game the Unsung Hero and I would love to hear about conquests! Or if you have any feedback for us as the creators, please feel free to reach out!<br /> <br /> Link here: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/290867/Searing-Wisdom\" target=\"_blank\">Searing Wisdom (STV)</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I wanted to express my personal thanks and gratitude to all of you out there that have chosen to support community-made material. Your support means a lot!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11633,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","user":"TheSly9","date":".  Typos 10-08-2019, 07:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/